  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Further strengthening the resilience and sustainability of the local food system for supplying social protection programmes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project objective is to strengthen the resilience, sustainability and nutritional focus of local food systems in 12 municipalities in the Eastern and Central provinces of Cuba to meet the differentiated demands of social safety nets.&#xB18D;&#xC5C5; &#xC0DD;&#xC0B0;&#xC790;&#xC640; &#xC0AC;&#xD68C;&#xBCF4;&#xC7A5; &#xD504;&#xB85C;&#xADF8;&#xB7A8; &#xAC04; &#xC5F0;&#xACC4; &#xAC15;&#xD654;, &#xB18D;&#xC0B0;&#xBB3C; &#xC0DD;&#xC0B0; &#xCD09;&#xC9C4;, &#xB18D;&#xC5C5; &#xC0DD;&#xC0B0; &#xBC0F; &#xC720;&#xD1B5; &#xC815;&#xCC45; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xAC15;&#xD654;, &#xC2DD;&#xC2B5;&#xAD00; &#xAC1C;&#xC120; &#xBC0F; &#xADE0;&#xD615;&#xC7A1;&#xD78C; &#xC601;&#xC591; &#xC12D;&#xCDE8; &#xCD09;&#xC9C4;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xB41C; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;, &#xC591;&#xC9C8;&#xC758; &#xADF8;&#xB9AC;&#xACE0; &#xB2E4;&#xC591;&#xD55C; &#xAE09;&#xC2DD; &#xACF5;&#xAE09;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD574; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;&#xB41C; &#xC0AC;&#xD68C;&#xBCF4;&#xC7A5; &#xD504;&#xB85C;&#xADF8;&#xB7A8;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The achievement of this objective will allow reaching the goal that the local food systems are able to meet the differentiated demands and nutritional recommendations of vulnerable groups throughout food based social safety nets all year long in targeted municipalities, to improve the food security and nutrition of local population.</narrative>
  </description>
